          <a href="#label" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. What Is in Loaded Protein</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. The Lineup</a>
          <a href="#which-one" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Which Ryse Protein to Buy</a>
          <a href="#cost" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Cost per 25 g of Protein</a>
          <a href="#testing" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Testing and Certifications</a>
          <a href="#who-skip" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Who Should Skip Ryse</a>
          <a href="#compare" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. How Ryse Compares</a>
          <a href="#use" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Using Ryse Well</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. Common Mistakes</a>
